112
00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:06.770
You know, we don't know what's coming down the pike.

113
00:05:06.770 --> 00:05:09.500
And if we're open-minded enough

114
00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:11.810
to start understanding, okay, I'm going to take...

115
00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:14.500
Now, this is a passive, it's a passive activity.

116
00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:15.370
You know, optimism is,

117
00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:19.540
I would call optimism proactive pathway.

118
00:05:19.540 --> 00:05:21.180
Open-mindedness as a passive pathway

119
00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:23.480
where you say, okay, I am going to be open

