129
00:05:47.180 --> 00:05:48.013
Yeah, yeah.

130
00:05:48.013 --> 00:05:49.855
And I think we all found ourselves

131
00:05:49.855 --> 00:05:51.620
in that situation in 2020.

132
00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:53.810
And again, I come back to this idea of asking questions.

133
00:05:53.810 --> 00:05:56.170
It's all, ultimately it comes down to the questions

134
00:05:56.170 --> 00:05:57.100
