00:06:22.180 --> 00:06:24.030
That's a little bit more of a leap, you know,

144
00:06:24.030 --> 00:06:27.670
but you can certainly start having a perspective

145
00:06:27.670 --> 00:06:28.657
without necessarily feeling it.

146
00:06:28.657 --> 00:06:30.680
And I think of it-
Curiosity.

147
00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.640
Curiosity. Curiosity is the buttress

148
00:06:32.640 --> 00:06:34.050
