151
00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.670
are automatically open-minded.

152
00:06:40.620 --> 00:06:43.060
So the reason why I didn't put curiosity there

153
00:06:43.060 --> 00:06:44.480
is because I think open-mindedness

154
00:06:44.480 --> 00:06:48.160
