159
00:07:00.727 --> 00:07:03.440
Let me see it in a different light, you know.

160
00:07:03.440 --> 00:07:05.250
Take myself out of my own perspective.

161
00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.110
If I'm not

162
00:07:07.150 --> 00:07:11.740
this 47-year-old male,

163
00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:14.840
former Navy Seal, author, living in Virginia,

164
00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:17.860
