as the Korean Vegan.

267
00:12:15.510 --> 00:12:17.370
And I don't even know what that is right now,

268
00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.090
because it hasn't seen its full potential.

269
00:12:19.090 --> 00:12:19.970
Sure.
I've never been able

270
00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:22.060
to identify it.
And you don't need to know.

271
00:12:22.060 --> 00:12:25.370
In a powerful addition to the Coach's Corner series,

272
00:12:25.370 --> 00:12:28.510
Olympians Chris Hauth and Caroline Burckle joined me

273
00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.920
