275
00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:38.530
as a tool for self-actualization.

276
00:12:38.530 --> 00:12:40.280
It's really stuck with me.

277
00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.973
Here is a slice of that conversation.

278
00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.470
To speak more towards the purpose,

279
00:12:46.470 --> 00:12:50.450
it's my enjoyment lies 100%

280
00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:55.450
in helping others get that sort of deep understanding

281
00:12:55.560 --> 00:12:58.980
of their why or their purpose or their path.

282
00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:00.360
I mean, the biggest frustration

283
00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:03.300
that many athletes that come to me have

284
00:13:03.300 --> 00:13:07.460
is that I keep telling them it will appear for you.

285
00:13:07.460 --> 00:13:09.040
Do not try to force it.

286
00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:12.060
You know, you can't manipulate your life path.

287
00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:13.710
And they don't wanna hear that.

288
00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:14.980
And it takes a few years,

289
00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:15.847
and then they'll come back and go,

