00:13:15.847 --> 00:13:18.450
"You know what, you were sort of right back then.

291
00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:21.080
I'm ready to take that journey now."

292
00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.330
But my power meter says this, Chris,

293
00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.150
and I need it to say this.

294
00:13:25.150 --> 00:13:27.880
Yes, but the only way it's gonna say that

295
00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.753
is if you let go and let, you know,

296
00:13:30.753 --> 00:13:32.740
it's like we know from swimming.

297
00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.853
It's like whenever we're too tight,

298
00:13:34.853 --> 00:13:38.240
(stammers) today this set is gonna be so intense.

299
00:13:38.240 --> 00:13:40.800
Like you try to get yourself mentally ready for it

300
00:13:40.800 --> 00:13:43.100
and then you get there and you're three or four repeats in

