00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:33.120
I might be doing a lot of mental work.

424
00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.180
Other people might be doing physical work.

425
00:18:36.180 --> 00:18:38.090
Other people are doing spiritual work.

426
00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:40.850
The training is the placeholder

427
00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:43.093
and what's being rebuilt in that building,

428
00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:46.280
is it a complete rebuild.,

429
00:18:46.280 --> 00:18:49.840
is it some sort of remodeling, right?

430
00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:52.750
But the training

431
00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.130
sets up the opportunity every day

432
00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:56.660
to spend time with yourself.

433
00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:58.890
And you might not want go in that day.

