00:19:27.510 --> 00:19:29.880
or with that emotion that just came up.

445
00:19:29.880 --> 00:19:33.390
But again, I think it's important that that curiosity

446
00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:35.870
sets up the training, the scaffolding

447
00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:38.970
so that you have an opportunity every day

448
00:19:38.970 --> 00:19:41.180
or every few days if you're not training every day,

449
00:19:41.180 --> 00:19:44.540
to sort of do that working in and working out.

450
00:19:44.540 --> 00:19:45.703
Yeah, I like that.

451
00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:49.660
When vegan transcontinental runner Hellah Sidibe

452
00:19:49.660 --> 00:19:50.880
