00:21:26.003 --> 00:21:28.255
Let me do this every day for a year."

502
00:21:28.255 --> 00:21:29.088
So that's how the whole run streak started.

503
00:21:29.088 --> 00:21:31.340
Right, so it was really born out

504
00:21:31.340 --> 00:21:32.710
of this frustration-
Yes, absolutely.

505
00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:34.430
and a little bit of confusion

506
00:21:34.430 --> 00:21:36.023
about what the next chapter was gonna look like.

507
00:21:36.023 --> 00:21:38.530
Yes, exactly, exactly. That's how it all started.

