00:33:52.320 --> 00:33:53.670
And I was like, there's no way.

841
00:33:53.670 --> 00:33:56.440
I just don't believe that this 16-year-old

842
00:33:56.440 --> 00:33:58.400
knows what's gonna happen to her.

843
00:33:58.400 --> 00:33:59.800
And that was so scary

844
00:33:59.800 --> 00:34:02.130
'cause I was like, is it gonna, am I a ticking time bomb?

845
00:34:02.130 --> 00:34:03.833
Does it just happen to people?

846
00:34:04.830 --> 00:34:08.070
And you know, her brother took his own...

847
00:34:08.070 --> 00:34:09.720
Like it runs deep in her family

848
00:34:09.720 --> 00:34:12.320
so I just knew that there was a possibility.

849
00:34:12.320 --> 00:34:13.920
And then when it did,

850
00:34:13.920 --> 00:34:17.570
but before I understood that there was a way to get better,

851
00:34:17.570 --> 00:34:19.950
I thought that that was just my fate.

852
00:34:19.950 --> 00:34:22.840
That like, that was, it now happened to me.

853
00:34:22.840 --> 00:34:25.810
And because the narrative I was told about her

854
00:34:25.810 --> 00:34:28.530
was she just had to go, like, she just,

855
00:34:28.530 --> 00:34:30.887
she was so sick that she had to go.

856
00:34:30.887 --> 00:34:33.810
And I was like, well, I guess I'm so sick

857
00:34:33.810 --> 00:34:35.140
