858
00:34:35.140 --> 00:34:37.370
'Cause what, I don't know what else there is.

859
00:34:37.370 --> 00:34:38.310
Wow.

860
00:34:38.310 --> 00:34:41.500
And that's so embarrassing honestly to share

861
00:34:41.500 --> 00:34:44.120
because I don't feel that way anymore,

862
00:34:44.120 --> 00:34:45.540
but I didn't understand.

863
00:34:45.540 --> 00:34:48.600
And I think it's sad that even someone

864
00:34:48.600 --> 00:34:50.370
who was susceptible to these things,

