00:34:53.940 --> 00:34:56.310
There was no prehab if you will,

867
00:34:56.310 --> 00:34:57.700
if you wanna call,

868
00:34:57.700 --> 00:34:59.380
if we wanna use this body comparison

869
00:34:59.380 --> 00:35:02.640
of the brain is a body part,

870
00:35:02.640 --> 00:35:03.640
I had no prehab.

871
00:35:03.640 --> 00:35:06.280
I had no preparation to deal with this.

872
00:35:06.280 --> 00:35:09.020
And it wasn't until my dad,

