877
00:35:20.460 --> 00:35:23.580
And that it could get injured like any other body part,

878
00:35:23.580 --> 00:35:26.240
but it could also heal like any other body part.

879
00:35:26.240 --> 00:35:30.130
And suddenly everything like it literally turned around

880
00:35:30.130 --> 00:35:30.963
in a day.

881
00:35:30.963 --> 00:35:32.300
Not, I wasn't happy,

882
00:35:32.300 --> 00:35:36.370
but I believed that I could be on a path to healing

883
00:35:37.880 --> 00:35:40.260
and that I could commit to it just like I would

884
00:35:40.260 --> 00:35:41.980
an Olympic dream.

885
00:35:41.980 --> 00:35:44.539
We are in a place where we can accept, I think,

886
00:35:44.539 --> 00:35:47.970
as a world that elite athletes and high-achievers

887
00:35:47.970 --> 00:35:52.190
can have these mental injuries, these mental illnesses.

888
00:35:52.190 --> 00:35:54.370
But I think the most important thing now

889
00:35:54.370 --> 00:35:57.980
is like, what do we do about them?

890
00:35:57.980 --> 00:36:00.063
And that was something that I found,

891
00:36:01.410 --> 00:36:03.910
I find that sometimes we point fingers

892
00:36:03.910 --> 00:36:07.560
at the pinnacle institutions that we're chasing.

893
00:36:07.560 --> 00:36:11.400
But actually I truly think that this kind of education

894
00:36:11.400 --> 00:36:13.810
or shift has to happen much younger

895
00:36:13.810 --> 00:36:17.040
and on a more universal level,

896
00:36:17.040 --> 00:36:19.510
not just at those pinnacles.

897
00:36:19.510 --> 00:36:21.750
So what would that look like if you were in charge

898
00:36:21.750 --> 00:36:24.340
and could put those things in place?

899
00:36:24.340 --> 00:36:27.943
Well, let's look at body,

