00:36:30.600 --> 00:36:32.050
and how that's progressed

902
00:36:32.050 --> 00:36:34.070
over the last, let's say 10 years.

903
00:36:34.070 --> 00:36:37.460
Like 10 years ago, I don't think my dad

904
00:36:37.460 --> 00:36:38.740
or my friend's little sister

905
00:36:38.740 --> 00:36:42.080
would have seen a PT for their body

906
00:36:43.130 --> 00:36:44.830
without having an injury,

907
00:36:44.830 --> 00:36:47.780
meaning like regularly take care of their body.

908
00:36:47.780 --> 00:36:50.220
And so just looking at that world,

909
00:36:50.220 --> 00:36:52.190
we've come a long way to accepting

910
00:36:52.190 --> 00:36:53.270
that our body is something

911
00:36:53.270 --> 00:36:55.730
not only elite athletes should take care of,

912
00:36:55.730 --> 00:36:57.530
but everybody should take care of

913
00:36:57.530 --> 00:36:59.020
and that we should take care of it

914
00:36:59.020 --> 00:37:00.740
before it's a problem ideally

915
00:37:00.740 --> 00:37:04.180
if you are able to have that kind of support.

916
00:37:04.180 --> 00:37:08.210
And it's not, there's just systems

917
00:37:08.210 --> 00:37:10.540
and you can always, you can get that kind of help

918
00:37:10.540 --> 00:37:12.800
if you can and need it, right?

919
00:37:12.800 --> 00:37:16.440
And I think with mental health, the comparing it

