00:37:20.260 --> 00:37:23.290
is so simple to me and makes so much sense.

922
00:37:23.290 --> 00:37:27.410
So what it would look like to me is accepting honestly

923
00:37:27.410 --> 00:37:30.690
that our brain is a body part and it can get injured.

924
00:37:30.690 --> 00:37:32.700
And when it gets injured,

925
00:37:32.700 --> 00:37:34.880
just like when we break our leg

926
