00:37:55.780 --> 00:37:57.980
Like there's just more accessibility,

935
00:37:57.980 --> 00:38:00.443
just like there is in the PT world.

936
00:38:01.390 --> 00:38:02.730
And then we get that help

937
00:38:02.730 --> 00:38:06.010
and we are as kind to ourselves as we are hard on ourselves,

938
00:38:06.010 --> 00:38:08.500
