00:38:32.270 --> 00:38:34.910
who see the world differently,

947
00:38:34.910 --> 00:38:37.550
finding joy in being wrong,

948
00:38:37.550 --> 00:38:41.210
and embracing the art of re-thinking.

949
00:38:41.210 --> 00:38:43.713
Prepare your noodle for this one.

950
00:38:45.260 --> 00:38:47.400
Right, so the idea, and this was the subject

