00:40:35.420 --> 00:40:36.253
Right.

996
00:40:36.253 --> 00:40:38.290
So let's dig into that a little bit deeper,

997
00:40:38.290 --> 00:40:41.430
but maybe we can start with elaborating a little bit more

998
00:40:41.430 --> 00:40:45.440
on this prosecutor, preacher, politician rubric

999
00:40:45.440 --> 00:40:47.280
that you've set up here.

1000
00:40:47.280 --> 00:40:48.113
The original idea comes

1001
00:40:48.113 --> 00:40:49.720
from a colleague of mine, Phil Tetlock,

1002
00:40:49.720 --> 00:40:53.130
who's studied political psychology and social psychology

1003
00:40:53.130 --> 00:40:54.640
most of his career.

