1034
00:42:04.490 --> 00:42:06.810
It's not actually changing what they believe internally

1035
00:42:06.810 --> 00:42:08.870
and that's just basically flip-flopping.

1036
00:42:08.870 --> 00:42:13.630
Yeah, I think I fall mostly into the politicking camp

1037
00:42:13.630 --> 00:42:14.880
as a (chuckles)...
Really?

